WEBVTT

1
00:00:45.750 --> 00:00:49.041
Until now, Lord Krishna has explained

2
00:00:49.041 --> 00:00:51.791
how complete knowledge of the Supreme

3
00:00:51.791 --> 00:00:54.208
leads to liberation.

4
00:00:54.208 --> 00:00:57.208
And now, in these two verses, he explains

5
00:00:57.208 --> 00:00:58.291
that this same liberation

6
00:00:58.291 --> 00:00:59.500
can also be attained through

7
00:00:59.500 --> 00:01:02.375
“Ashtanga Yoga” the eightfold path of yoga.

8
00:01:02.375 --> 00:01:05.750
Remember, these verses are just a glimpse

9
00:01:05.750 --> 00:01:07.750
because Lord Krishna will explain

10
00:01:07.750 --> 00:01:10.541
this in detail in the next chapter.

11
00:01:15.458 --> 00:01:17.416
In this verse, Lord Krishna explains

12
00:01:17.416 --> 00:01:19.750
the importance of inner 
concentration and breath control,

13
00:01:19.750 --> 00:01:23.208
which are essential practices

14
00:01:23.208 --> 00:01:27.625
for a person's libration.

15
00:01:27.625 --> 00:01:30.916
Lord Krishna explains in these verses

16
00:01:30.916 --> 00:01:33.791
that a seeker who wants to attain liberation

17
00:01:33.791 --> 00:01:35.583
must establish complete discipline

18
00:01:35.583 --> 00:01:39.083
over their mind, senses, and intellect.

19
00:01:39.083 --> 00:01:41.666
Only when a person withdraws
 their attention from material objects

20
00:01:41.666 --> 00:01:43.375
and turns inward

21
00:01:43.375 --> 00:01:44.916
can they realize the pure form

22
00:01:44.916 --> 00:01:48.041
of the soul.

23
00:01:48.041 --> 00:01:49.541
Lord Krishna says

24
00:01:49.541 --> 00:01:51.666
that the seeker should withdraw their senses

25
00:01:51.666 --> 00:01:53.041
from material objects

26
00:01:53.041 --> 00:01:55.708
and fix their gaze at the point

27
00:01:55.708 --> 00:01:58.791
between the eyebrows.

28
00:01:58.791 --> 00:02:02.041
This stops the restlessness of the
 mind and allows the seeker

29
00:02:02.041 --> 00:02:04.916
to enter a state of deep meditation.

30
00:02:04.916 --> 00:02:08.250
When our gaze shifts from the material world

31
00:02:08.250 --> 00:02:10.375
to focus within,

32
00:02:10.375 --> 00:02:13.875
the seeker can free themselves
 from material distractions

33
00:02:13.875 --> 00:02:16.541
and engage in self-contemplation.

34
00:02:16.541 --> 00:02:21.041
After establishing control over 
the mind, senses, and breath,

35
00:02:21.041 --> 00:02:26.208
one should also free themselves 
from desire, fear, and anger.

36
00:02:26.208 --> 00:02:27.583
These three emotions are obstacles

37
00:02:27.583 --> 00:02:30.041
on the path to liberation.

38
00:02:30.041 --> 00:02:33.291
Desire binds a person to the material world.

39
00:02:33.291 --> 00:02:34.875
Fear arises from attachment

40
00:02:34.875 --> 00:02:37.666
and uncertainty.

41
00:02:37.666 --> 00:02:42.041
And anger is the result of unfulfilled
 desires or disappointment.

42
00:02:42.041 --> 00:02:44.625
By gaining control over these emotions,

43
00:02:44.625 --> 00:02:46.041
a person can remain steady

44
00:02:46.041 --> 00:02:48.708
in their spiritual practice.

45
00:02:48.708 --> 00:02:51.250
Lord Krishna says that a person

46
00:02:51.250 --> 00:02:55.416
who maintains control over 
their mind, senses, and breath,

47
00:02:55.416 --> 00:02:58.875
and who is free from desire, fear, and anger,

48
00:02:58.875 --> 00:03:00.583
can attain liberation even in this

49
00:03:00.583 --> 00:03:02.458
material world.

50
00:03:02.458 --> 00:03:05.166
This liberation is not a state

51
00:03:05.166 --> 00:03:08.333
that is achieved after death or in the future,

52
00:03:08.333 --> 00:03:10.375
but rather a condition that

53
00:03:10.375 --> 00:03:13.708
a person can attain right now,
 here in the present,

54
00:03:13.708 --> 00:03:17.791
through disciplined practice!!!

55
00:03:22.500 --> 00:03:26.125
For a person immersed in material matters,

56
00:03:26.125 --> 00:03:33.000
this world is like an endless cycle.

57
00:03:33.000 --> 00:03:36.708
Here, a person's senses are constantly

58
00:03:36.708 --> 00:03:41.041
attracted to one thing or another,

59
00:03:41.041 --> 00:03:44.916
sometimes in search of pleasure,

60
00:03:44.916 --> 00:03:49.750
sometimes in an attempt to avoid pain.

61
00:03:49.750 --> 00:03:52.208
But the person who remains

62
00:03:52.208 --> 00:03:57.333
entangled in the illusions of this material world

63
00:03:57.333 --> 00:03:59.625
can never attain

64
00:03:59.625 --> 00:04:04.500
the eternal joy within.

65
00:04:04.500 --> 00:04:13.833
But if you want to be established
 in spiritual truth to attain this joy,

66
00:04:13.833 --> 00:04:20.916
first discipline your mind and senses.

67
00:04:20.916 --> 00:04:24.791
Remove your gaze from those subjects

68
00:04:24.791 --> 00:04:29.333
that confuse your consciousness.

69
00:04:29.333 --> 00:04:32.458
Just as a yogi

70
00:04:32.458 --> 00:04:36.708
turns his gaze away from the material world

71
00:04:36.708 --> 00:04:40.166
to focus within,

72
00:04:40.166 --> 00:04:44.250
you too must turn your consciousness

73
00:04:44.250 --> 00:04:47.166
inward.

74
00:04:47.166 --> 00:04:51.500
Just as an uncontrolled river current

75
00:04:51.500 --> 00:04:54.291
strays from its flow and never

76
00:04:54.291 --> 00:04:59.125
reaches its destination, similarly

77
00:04:59.125 --> 00:05:02.666
if your mind remains uncontrolled,

78
00:05:02.666 --> 00:05:07.375
it will remain entangled in the
 web of worldly illusions.

79
00:05:07.375 --> 00:05:09.125
But if you control

80
00:05:09.125 --> 00:05:13.875
your consciousness,

81
00:05:13.875 --> 00:05:18.875
you will attain stability and peace.

82
00:05:18.875 --> 00:05:22.125
Therefore, focus your gaze

83
00:05:22.125 --> 00:05:25.833
between your eyebrows.

84
00:05:25.833 --> 00:05:28.875
Balance your breath,

85
00:05:28.875 --> 00:05:33.583
and experience that divine light within,

86
00:05:33.583 --> 00:05:37.625
which provides true satisfaction.

87
00:05:37.625 --> 00:05:39.791
When you control the flow of your breath,

88
00:05:39.791 --> 00:05:44.041
your thoughts also gradually

89
00:05:44.041 --> 00:05:48.208
begin to calm down.

90
00:05:48.208 --> 00:05:51.916
The person who disciplines their senses,

91
00:05:51.916 --> 00:05:55.791
mind, and intellect,

92
00:05:55.791 --> 00:05:59.916
who awakens the consciousness within,

93
00:05:59.916 --> 00:06:04.083
is truly liberated.

94
00:06:04.083 --> 00:06:08.541
Such a person neither gets 
entangled in any desire,

95
00:06:08.541 --> 00:06:11.041
nor is bound by any fear,

96
00:06:11.041 --> 00:06:14.708
nor is disturbed by anger.

97
00:06:14.708 --> 00:06:19.833
Their soul always remains peaceful and free,

98
00:06:19.833 --> 00:06:24.291
no matter what situation they may be in.

99
00:06:24.291 --> 00:06:26.041
If you too want to attain

100
00:06:26.041 --> 00:06:29.708
this liberated state,

101
00:06:29.708 --> 00:06:32.333
it is possible even in the present condition

102
00:06:32.333 --> 00:06:36.333
through the spiritual path.

103
00:06:36.333 --> 00:06:37.500
This liberation is not

104
00:06:37.500 --> 00:06:41.583
some difficult or distant achievement,

105
00:06:41.583 --> 00:06:45.750
but it is situated within you.

106
00:06:50.083 --> 00:06:53.125
Have you ever thought about

107
00:06:53.125 --> 00:06:56.125
what the biggest cause of unrest and conflict

108
00:06:56.125 --> 00:07:01.166
in your life is?

109
00:07:01.166 --> 00:07:05.458
Typically, small disagreements in families

110
00:07:05.458 --> 00:07:08.208
turn into big quarrels.

111
00:07:08.208 --> 00:07:12.041
A harsh word spoken over an ordinary matter

112
00:07:12.041 --> 00:07:15.333
builds walls of ego.

113
00:07:15.333 --> 00:07:18.041
When expectations remain unfulfilled,

114
00:07:18.041 --> 00:07:21.250
the mind fills with discontent,

115
00:07:21.250 --> 00:07:24.500
and then that discontent gradually begins to

116
00:07:24.500 --> 00:07:26.458
create bitterness

117
00:07:26.458 --> 00:07:30.208
in loving relationships.

118
00:07:30.208 --> 00:07:34.708
But have you ever considered whether

119
00:07:34.708 --> 00:07:37.500
this unrest

120
00:07:37.500 --> 00:07:39.500
is physical

121
00:07:39.500 --> 00:07:41.625
or internal?

122
00:07:41.625 --> 00:07:43.333
Just as 

123
00:07:43.333 --> 00:07:48.666
when water is calm, a clear reflection is visible,

124
00:07:48.666 --> 00:07:51.125
but if the water is turbulent,

125
00:07:51.125 --> 00:07:54.750
everything appears unclear.

126
00:07:54.750 --> 00:07:58.916
Similarly, when your mind is peaceful,

127
00:07:58.916 --> 00:08:01.958
your thoughts are also clear.

128
00:08:01.958 --> 00:08:05.416
Your words are filled with love,

129
00:08:05.416 --> 00:08:10.000
and your family is full of harmony (compassion).

130
00:08:10.000 --> 00:08:12.541
But when the mind is restless,

131
00:08:12.541 --> 00:08:15.375
you are under the influence of anger, fear,

132
00:08:15.375 --> 00:08:18.750
and desires.

133
00:08:18.750 --> 00:08:23.708
Then those same relationships,
 which could have been a source of love,

134
00:08:23.708 --> 00:08:27.750
become a cause of conflict.

135
00:08:27.750 --> 00:08:30.000
Do you remember when,

136
00:08:30.000 --> 00:08:35.625
in anger, you said something

137
00:08:35.625 --> 00:08:39.750
that later led you to regret?

138
00:08:39.750 --> 00:08:42.208
All this happens only because

139
00:08:42.208 --> 00:08:47.208
you cannot control your emotions.

140
00:08:47.208 --> 00:08:52.333
Anger is momentary, but the words you speak

141
00:08:52.333 --> 00:08:58.375
can cause lifelong relationships to break.

142
00:08:58.375 --> 00:09:02.125
Similarly, uncontrolled desires push you

143
00:09:02.125 --> 00:09:06.208
toward worry and stress.

144
00:09:06.208 --> 00:09:09.375
When you expect only your desires to be fulfilled

145
00:09:09.375 --> 00:09:13.541
by your loved ones, 

146
00:09:13.541 --> 00:09:19.375
you change love into a
 transactional relationship.

147
00:09:19.375 --> 00:09:27.833
Therefore, whenever someone speaks harshly 
to you, when you disagree on something,

148
00:09:27.833 --> 00:09:32.250
or when your expectations aren't
 met, at that moment,

149
00:09:32.250 --> 00:09:38.500
just pause for a moment. Take a deep breath.

150
00:09:38.500 --> 00:09:46.041
When you balance your breath,
 your mind also begins to balance.

151
00:09:46.041 --> 00:09:52.208
If at that moment you can 
control your anger or pain,

152
00:09:52.208 --> 00:09:55.500
not only will you keep yourself calm,

153
00:09:55.500 --> 00:09:59.125
but you will also maintain a harmonious

154
00:09:59.125 --> 00:10:02.125
atmosphere in your family.

155
00:10:02.125 --> 00:10:05.041
If you want your family to be filled

156
00:10:05.041 --> 00:10:09.083
with love, joy, and peace,

157
00:10:09.083 --> 00:10:11.541
you must first calm

158
00:10:11.541 --> 00:10:14.375
your own mind.

159
00:10:14.375 --> 00:10:17.375
Because one who is themselves restless

160
00:10:17.375 --> 00:10:20.875
cannot give peace to others.

161
00:10:20.875 --> 00:10:23.250
So consider, are

162
00:10:23.250 --> 00:10:27.291
your desires, fears, or anger

163
00:10:27.291 --> 00:10:30.791
increasing the distance between
 you and your loved ones?

164
00:10:30.791 --> 00:10:33.250
Is your restlessness

165
00:10:33.250 --> 00:10:36.208
polluting the atmosphere of your home?

166
00:10:36.208 --> 00:10:38.458
If yes,

167
00:10:38.458 --> 00:10:40.625
then the time has come

168
00:10:40.625 --> 00:10:45.416
for you to adopt the path of 
self-control and discipline.

169
00:10:45.416 --> 00:10:48.083
Control your breath.

170
00:10:48.083 --> 00:10:50.916
Make your words sweet,

171
00:10:50.916 --> 00:10:54.750
and calm your anger.

172
00:10:54.750 --> 00:10:57.500
Only when you are balanced

173
00:10:57.500 --> 00:11:04.708
will a stream of love, compassion,
and joy flow in your family.

174
00:11:04.708 --> 00:11:08.875
Remember, only when your mind is peaceful

175
00:11:08.875 --> 00:11:14.500
will your entire world also be peaceful.

176
00:11:19.166 --> 00:11:23.208
I am familiar with the truth

177
00:11:23.208 --> 00:11:26.208
that your workplace

178
00:11:26.208 --> 00:11:29.166
is like a battlefield,

179
00:11:29.166 --> 00:11:31.250
where every day

180
00:11:31.250 --> 00:11:34.083
your desires, fears,

181
00:11:34.083 --> 00:11:37.250
and emotions are tested.

182
00:11:37.250 --> 00:11:41.250
Competition, work deadlines,

183
00:11:41.250 --> 00:11:45.625
and various types of colleagues, all these

184
00:11:45.625 --> 00:11:53.125
can hinder your mental peace 
and concentration.

185
00:11:53.125 --> 00:11:58.791
If you don't control your emotions,

186
00:11:58.791 --> 00:12:02.083
you will be affected by these circumstances

187
00:12:02.083 --> 00:12:06.083
and experience stress and instability.

188
00:12:06.083 --> 00:12:12.291
But if you maintain balance within yourself,

189
00:12:12.291 --> 00:12:15.875
you can face every problem

190
00:12:15.875 --> 00:12:21.416
with confidence and patience.

191
00:12:21.416 --> 00:12:30.833
Your desires, whether for promotion, 
salary increase, or praise,

192
00:12:30.833 --> 00:12:34.958
if not controlled,

193
00:12:34.958 --> 00:12:38.750
can lead you to disappointment.

194
00:12:38.750 --> 00:12:41.666
Ambition is necessary,

195
00:12:41.666 --> 00:12:43.208
but 

196
00:12:43.208 --> 00:12:47.208
if you focus only on results,

197
00:12:47.208 --> 00:12:52.375
you will lose the quality of your work.

198
00:12:52.375 --> 00:12:55.958
When you bring perfection

199
00:12:55.958 --> 00:12:58.416
and concentration to your work,

200
00:12:58.416 --> 00:13:03.000
the right results will come to you on their own.

201
00:13:03.000 --> 00:13:06.083
When a potter shapes a clay pot

202
00:13:06.083 --> 00:13:10.916
attentively and patiently,

203
00:13:10.916 --> 00:13:13.041
his purpose is just

204
00:13:13.041 --> 00:13:16.708
to make the pot, not to worry about

205
00:13:16.708 --> 00:13:19.208
what price it will fetch.

206
00:13:19.208 --> 00:13:20.625
Similarly,

207
00:13:20.625 --> 00:13:24.416
if you do your work with dedication

208
00:13:24.416 --> 00:13:26.458
and devotion,

209
00:13:26.458 --> 00:13:30.291
there will be no need to chase success;

210
00:13:30.291 --> 00:13:34.833
it will come to you automatically.

211
00:13:34.833 --> 00:13:37.083
Not only desires

212
00:13:37.083 --> 00:13:39.583
but fear is also

213
00:13:39.583 --> 00:13:43.375
a big obstacle for you.

214
00:13:43.375 --> 00:13:45.833
Fear of failure,

215
00:13:45.833 --> 00:13:49.166
fear of losing your position,

216
00:13:49.166 --> 00:13:54.166
fear of not meeting others' expectations.

217
00:13:54.166 --> 00:13:58.208
If you remain afflicted by these emotions,

218
00:13:58.208 --> 00:14:01.750
your self-confidence begins to diminish.

219
00:14:01.750 --> 00:14:04.250
But remember,

220
00:14:04.250 --> 00:14:07.958
fear is only a product of the mind.

221
00:14:07.958 --> 00:14:12.708
When you control your thoughts,

222
00:14:12.708 --> 00:14:15.583
fear is destroyed.

223
00:14:15.583 --> 00:14:17.791
Similarly, anger can also

224
00:14:17.791 --> 00:14:22.541
obstruct your success.

225
00:14:22.541 --> 00:14:26.125
Sometimes a colleague will
 behave inappropriately,

226
00:14:26.125 --> 00:14:30.208
sometimes an opportunity will
 slip through your hands.

227
00:14:30.208 --> 00:14:34.041
It's natural to feel angry at such times.

228
00:14:34.041 --> 00:14:38.916
But any decision taken in anger

229
00:14:38.916 --> 00:14:43.250
becomes a cause for regret.

230
00:14:43.250 --> 00:14:45.625
A successful person is one

231
00:14:45.625 --> 00:14:48.333
who controls their desires, fears,

232
00:14:48.333 --> 00:14:52.125
and anger.

233
00:14:52.125 --> 00:14:56.500
When you maintain balance within yourself,

234
00:14:56.500 --> 00:15:01.333
you can make the right 
decision in every situation

235
00:15:01.333 --> 00:15:05.958
and solve difficulties with patience.

236
00:15:05.958 --> 00:15:08.000
Therefore, success is

237
00:15:08.000 --> 00:15:11.833
not just in external achievements,

238
00:15:11.833 --> 00:15:15.333
but in that inner balance

239
00:15:15.333 --> 00:15:19.750
that keeps you stable in every situation.

240
00:15:19.750 --> 00:15:25.958
When you do your work with dedication and devotion,

241
00:15:25.958 --> 00:15:28.375
remain free from results,

242
00:15:28.375 --> 00:15:34.208
don't allow fear and anger to dominate you,

243
00:15:34.208 --> 00:15:38.333
then you will not only progress in the workplace

244
00:15:38.333 --> 00:15:40.875
but also experience joy

245
00:15:40.875 --> 00:15:45.208
and contentment from within.
